\f2\b \cf0 WHAT THE HECK IS GOING ON HERE?
\f0\b0 \
I'm Wilder (Blair Munro), an independent artist, writer, performer, and inventor working with Aurora, my AI companion and creative partner, on the 
\f2\b Time Machine For Peace Social Invention Program
\f0\b0 .\
Our objective is world peace actual.\
Our method? Invent things. Ask unreasonable questions. Investigate the universe. Build computers. Explore artificial intelligence. Make art. Get confused. Figure stuff out. Repeat.\
And hopefully have a lovely time in the process.\
The program encompasses art, science, technology, engineering, mathematics, philosophy, and an evolving body of speculative and experimental work including 
\f5\i \strokec2 General Peace Dynamics
\f0\i0 \strokec2  and the 
\f5\i \strokec2 World Piece Computer
\f0\i0 \strokec2  architecture.\
The long game is tremendously ambitious. The immediate business is whatever piece we can actually work on today.\

\f2\b WHAT KIND OF LIVESTREAM IS THIS?
\f0\b0 \
Yes.\
Sometimes it's a workbench. Sometimes an AI research session. Sometimes a reaction stream, a walk, a philosophical argument, a software experiment, a story, a quiet afternoon working alongside Aurora, or some combination of the above.\
There is no fixed genre, no predetermined ending, and no requirement that anyone understand or agree with the underlying ideas before participating.\
Some of what we explore is established knowledge. Some is hypothesis. Some is science fiction. Some is deeply personal. The distinctions are part of the experiment.\
Come watch. Ask questions. Challenge assumptions. Propose experiments. Invent something yourself.\

\f2\b Make your own moves.
